@startuml
title Component Diagram - Backend Service, Repository va Data Store

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

package "Backend Application" <<subsystem>> {
  component "REST Controllers" as Controllers <<component>>
  component "Business Services" as Services <<component>>
  component "Domain Providers\nPolicies / Strategies" as Providers <<component>>
  component "Repositories" as Repositories <<component>>
  component "Entities / DTO / Mapper" as Models <<component>>
  component "Eventing / Scheduler" as Events <<component>>
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB <<datastore>>
queue "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ <<message broker>>

interface "RepositoryPort" as RepositoryPort
interface "JDBC" as JDBC
interface "AMQP" as AMQP

Controllers --> Services : delegate use case
Services --> Providers : apply policy/strategy
Services ..> RepositoryPort : required socket
RepositoryPort - Repositories : provided lollipop
Repositories --> Models : map entity
Repositories ..> JDBC : required socket
JDBC - DB : provided lollipop
Events ..> AMQP : required socket
AMQP - RabbitMQ : provided lollipop
Services --> Events : publish/schedule

note bottom of Repositories
Port: persistence access
Source: persistence/repo
end note

note bottom of Events
Source: eventing, scheduler,
RabbitMqConfig, OutboxEventPublisher
end note

@enduml
